xact"],["a-s083-0158","ن ض ر","B002","root_001516","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0159","ن ظ ر","B001","root_001520","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0160","ن ظ ر","B002","root_001520","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0161","ن ظ ر","B003","root_001520","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0162","ن ظ ر","B009","root_001520","B009","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0163","ن ع م","B001","root_001525","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0164","ن ع م","B002","root_001525","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0165","ن ف س","B001","root_001533","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0166","ن ف س","B010","root_001533","B010","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0167","ن ف س","B014","root_001533","B014","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0168","ن و س","B001","root_004965","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0169","و ج ه","B001","root_001630","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0170","و ز ن","B001","root_001645","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0171","و ز ن","B002","root_001645","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0172","و ز ن","B007","root_001645","B007","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0173","و ف ي","B001","root_001669","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0174","و ف ي","B002","root_001669","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0175","و ف ي","B003","root_001669","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0176","و ف ي","B004","root_001669","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s083-0177","ي و م","B003","root_001700","B003","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s083-0038","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",55,"83:3","1. **The instrument of quantity becomes an instrument of rank.** Lexical evidence: ك ي ل/B001 in كَالُوهُمْ; و ز ن/B001, \"measuring a thing by weight,\" and B007, \"standing or value that carries weight,\" in وَّزَنُوهُمْ; خ س ر/B003 in يُخْسِرُونَ. Structural cue: the attached human objects هُم occur twice, while 83:2 called those objects ٱلنَّاس. Assigned role: the scale quantifies goods but simultaneously assigns diminished human worth. Abductive move: I infer that repeated pronominal attachment makes the loss socially adhere to recipients; the packet gives grammar and B007 but not the causal interpretation. Reading change: the ayah is not only about less product; it exposes a weighing practice that treats other people as carrying less weight."],["a-s083-0045","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",103,"83:6","1. **Standing as resurrection and audit.** Lexical evidence: ق و م/B013, \"resurrection and rising of the Hour,\" and B010, \"value, valuation, and pricing,\" in يَقُومُ. Structural cue: 83:1-3 establishes manipulated measure and value; 83:7-9 establishes the written marked record; 83:11 names the day through د ي ن/B002 reckoning. Assigned role: B013 supplies the bodily assembly, while B010 turns that assembly into revaluation. Abductive move: I infer an audit from the commercial and documentary frames; the packet supplies all components but does not state that B010 governs this form. Reading change: standing is the moment persons and practices are priced truthfully, not merely a posture after resurrection."],["a-s083-0044","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",103,"83:6","1. **Standing as resurrection and audit.** Lexical evidence: ق و م/B013, \"resurrection and rising of the Hour,\" and B010, \"value, valuation, and pricing,\" in يَقُومُ. Structural cue: 83:1-3 establishes manipulated measure and value; 83:7-9 establishes the written marked record; 83:11 names the day through د ي ن/B002 reckoning. Assigned role: B013 supplies the bodily assembly, while B010 turns that assembly into revaluation. Abductive move: I infer an audit from the commercial and documentary frames; the packet supplies all components but does not state that B010 governs this form. Reading change: standing is the moment persons and practices are priced truthfully, not merely a posture after resurrection."],["a-s083-0044","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",103,"83:6","1. **Standing as resurrection and audit.** Lexical evidence: ق و م/B013, \"resurrection and rising of the Hour,\" and B010, \"value, valuation, and pricing,\" in يَقُومُ. Structural cue: 83:1-3 establishes manipulated measure and value; 83:7-9 establishes the written marked record; 83:11 names the day through د ي ن/B002 reckoning. Assigned role: B013 supplies the bodily assembly, while B010 turns that assembly into revaluation. Abductive move: I infer an audit from the commercial and documentary frames; the packet supplies all components but does not state that B010 governs this form. Reading change: standing is the moment persons and practices are priced truthfully, not merely a posture after resurrection."],["a-s083-0061","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",157,"83:9","3. **A mark that becomes an experienced calamity.** Lexical evidence: ر ق م/B006, \"calamity that leaves a mark,\" secondarily activated in مَّرْقُومٌ. Structural cue: 83:14 later makes accumulated earnings settle over hearts through ر ي ن/B002/B003. Assigned role: B006 bridges the external inscription and the internal effect that becomes difficult to escape. Abductive move: I infer that the recorded mark and the heart's overlay are two surfaces of one accumulation; only their proximity and material imagery are supplied. Reading change: \"marked\" carries a reciprocal force: deeds mark the record, and the resulting recordable pattern marks the doer."],["a-s083-0052","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",407,"83:24","3. **Freshness carries the purity of precious material.** Lexical evidence: ن ض ر/B002, \"bright purity of gold,\" behind نَضْرَةَ, alongside direct B001. Structural cue: 83:25 names a pure choice drink through ر ح ق/B001, seals it, and 83:26 gives musk; 83:27 traces its mixture to an elevated source. Assigned role: B002 supplies a material analogy of untarnished brightness to the face. Abductive move: I infer that purity of provision is embodied as purity of complexion; no physical transfer is stated. Reading change: the radiance reads as durable, precious clarity rather than a momentary smile."],["a-s083-0118","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",441,"83:26","3. **Resolve replaces self-exultation.** Lexical evidence: ن ف س/B014, \"self-regard, resolve, and noble character,\" activated in the reciprocal forms. Structural cue: the command to compete is followed by criminals laughing, signaling, and returning home فَكِهِينَ (83:29-31; ف ك ه/B006, insolent exultance). Assigned role: B014 supplies disciplined inner mettle; the later group supplies distorted self-regard fed by another's humiliation. Abductive move: I infer that both are rival formations of the self because the sequence contrasts their desired rewards. Reading change: فَلْيَتَنَافَسِ calls for a durable reconstitution of resolve, not a burst of acquisitive envy."],["a-s083-0053","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",475,"83:28","3. **The choicest part supplies the whole mixture.** Lexical evidence: ع ي ن/B014, \"the choice part of a thing,\" activated in عَيْنًۭا. Structural cue: ر ح ق/B001 named the served drink pure and choice at 83:25; 83:27 identifies Tasnim as its mixture; this ayah identifies Tasnim as a spring. Assigned role: B014 explains how a source can function as the select constituent that elevates a composite drink. Abductive move: I infer part-to-mixture quality transfer from the three-ayah sequence. Reading change: the spring is not only spatial origin but the concentrated choice element whose presence characterizes the provision."],["a-s083-0089","v12/runs_11ayah/s083/full_context_control/reader_s083_a_ayah_walk.md",565,"83:33","3. **They cannot certify who is on the continuous road.** Lexical evidence: ح ف ظ/B007, \"clear unbroken road,\" secondarily activated in حَٰفِظِينَ. Structural cue: the previous ayah calls believers astray through ض ل ل/B001; the next two reverse laughter and place believers on stable couches looking. Assigned role: B007 supplies the very road-continuity about which the mockers pretend to judge. Abductive move: I infer that lack of guardianship entails lack of authority to certify another's route; this branch is materially distant from the agent noun, so the activation is exploratory. Reading change: the clause removes from the mockers both custody of persons and custody of the map."]]}
